<title>SWEDEN: Average yield 4.29 pct on Swedish Jan T-bills.</title>
<headline>Average yield 4.29 pct on Swedish Jan T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of 15 billion crowns worth of Treasury bills, with a maturity date of January 8, 1997, had an average yield of 4.29 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The auction, announced earlier Tuesday, saw a lowest rate of 4.25 percent and highest accepted rate of 4.31 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
